  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c641f0240fccdbf4e8d5617e34811eb8, type: 3}
  m_Name: G_EnvyDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueContainerWithModels
  speakerIds: []
  speakerPrefabs: []
  nodes:
  - nodeId: 0
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: You're overflowing with <ainm:wave>ENVY<anim:none>, aren't you?
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 1
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: "Perched atop the roof of a drab five-story apartment block, you lifted
      your eyes toward the gilded towers beyond\u2014new buildings that seemed to
      let ultraviolet light pass through them, purifying it of the stale scent of
      routine."
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 2
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Evening came on slowly, and as you yawned there was something unbecoming
      in your admiration.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 3
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Then you lowered your gaze and found, beneath your feet, seventeen meters
      of oxygen-rich air stretching toward the ground, and a coin gleaming as brightly
      as those glittering high-rises.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 4
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: 'You picked it up, telling yourself that one day you''d find enough coins
      to buy an enormous concrete sphere and send it crashing through every one of
      those arrogant buildings, showering their residents with a rain of glass.

      

'
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 5
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: 'Then it struck you: you would never collect that many.'
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 6
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: 'Every coin would be found first by carefree wanderers, who would snatch
      them away and spend them all on cigarettes that tasted one and a half times
      better than yours. '
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 7
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: That difference in flavor was enough to drown out the bitter tobacco lingering
      from the cigarette butt already tumbling down through the floors, leaving only
      its taste in your mouth.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 8
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: The soulless lampposts wore a mocking, needle-sharp grin, tainting that
      taste with waves of nausea until your throat filled with vomit.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 9
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: ' It joined the dance of the air, gathering speed as it fell, tangling
      itself in the hair of passersby dragging suitcases made from fine leather.'
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 10
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: The mist shrouding your memories is beginning to thin, isn't it?
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 11
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Five is all fate will allow you. Choose.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
